Empathy map





Reason: I reuse and refine the empathy map from Empathize to connect user goals, frustrations, thoughts and behaviours directly to requirements, for example “marketers need to launch pages quickly without asking developers” becoming a self‑service requirement. By mapping what stakeholders say, think, do and feel during the landing‑page workflow, I can check whether the requirement groups really reflect their experience and whether any important needs are missing.





