Personas





Reason: I create and refine lightweight personas (for example “EMEA campaign marketer”, “digital/front‑end developer”, “product stakeholder”) to represent the main user types of the template system and their different needs, skills and constraints. These personas help me balance requirements between speed and flexibility for marketers, and maintainability and technical quality for developers, and prevent me from optimising the template system only for a single role.





