Results
The Test step delivers a clear overview of how well the new template system performs in a realistic campaign situation, including where it improves usability, reduces effort and supports more consistent page outcomes. It also shows whether the AI prototype is useful enough to keep exploring, or whether it is better treated as a future idea rather than part of the core solution.




Conclusion
